  <section class="section privacy-content"><h2>Browser storage</h2><p>This website uses browser local storage to remember that you have acknowledged the privacy notice. If local reactions or comments are enabled on a page, those preferences may also be stored on the device you use.</p><h2>Information you send</h2><p>If you contact me by email, the information you include is handled by your email provider and used to respond to your message. Do not send sensitive personal information through a general contact email.</p><h2>Third-party services</h2><p>Links to external websites are provided for convenience. Those services have their own privacy practices. This site does not currently require an account or ask visitors to submit personal details to browse its pages.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can clear this site’s stored data through your browser settings. You can also use browser privacy and data-saver features to limit storage and data use.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>For privacy questions, contact <a href="mailto:kastineaugak@gmail.com">kastineaugak@gmail.com</a>.</p></section>
